# fixedbugs, defect 373, lane cli12, 2026-10-06. THIS FILE ENDS ITS LINES
# WITH CRLF, and `.gitattributes` keeps them (`-text`).
#
# SYMPTOM: a message placed at a line's end, `expected_expression` where a
# line ends after `=`, or after an operator and a comment above a binding,
# said one column more than the same file with LF line ends, 16:9 for 16:8:
# the carriage return was counted as a character of the line (12 of 137
# check cases made CRLF, panel 193's completeness critic).
#
# FIX: `source.line_col` gives the line feed of a `\r\n` the carriage
# return's column, the line's end, as an LF file gives its line feed.

function main()
    a = 1
    #~v expected_expression
    x =
    y = a +  #~ expected_expression
    z = 2
    print(a + z)
